v 3
d conformalpred: Split-conformal prediction intervals for regress and poisson
d
d conformalpred wraps an ordinary regress or poisson fit and adds
d distribution-free prediction intervals. It splits the estimation
d sample, refits on the training half, takes the calibration quantile
d of the absolute prediction errors, and writes lower and upper bound
d variables with a finite-sample coverage guarantee that does not
d depend on normal or homoskedastic errors (Shafer & Vovk 2008).
d
d Requires: Stata 16.0 or newer
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Sr Researcher, Texas 2036
d Support: eric.a.booth@gmail.com
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260706
d
